              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gail"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a spice cake and butterscotch pudding combo and it was great , very moist but a bit heavy.. the sauce was amazing but way to sweet even for me.. I also used crushed walnut and it was really good but I'd suggest cutting the recipe down by at least half as I have a ridiculous amount left over.. overall it was great",
